Add a DMA-BUF import entry point that consumes its fd on every outcome.

The allocation observer distinguishes failure before import from failure after
Vulkan consumed the descriptor. The upstream entry point keeps its semantics.

--- a/Granite/vulkan/vulkan_common.hpp
